    { "\u005B" }EMERGENCY EVACUATION PROTOCOL{ "\u005D" }
    Please take a seat in the pod and fasten your safety harness.
    Destination: Central Command.
    Await launch.
    { "\u002E" }..Unauthorized connection detected...
    { "\u002E" }..Attempting lockout...
    ERROR.
    { "\u002E" }..Control seized.
    { "\u005B" }SYSTEM OVERRIDDEN: SPIDER CLAN{ "\u005D" }
    { "\u002E" }..Identifying operative...
    { "\u002E" }..Mission status: SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED.
    Yoku yatta!
    Congratulations, { $target }!
    You have served the clan with honor. Honor is preserved and the objective is complete.
    New destination: { "\u005B" }DATA DELETED{ "\u005D" }.
    Keep your weapons. You will need them again.
    { "\u002E" }..Kumo no ichizoku wa wasurenai...
    The Spider Clan remembers its own.
    Sayonara, shinobi.
